      "message": "Agreed, and implemented in PS6: payload_to_info and udp_packet_to_info are gone; callers use get_info_from_packet(packet). It reads the UDP bytes before Scapy reinterprets them and also handles Raw and ICMPv6 Echo packets. One intentional offset remains: the IPsec policy tests put their info after an ISAKMP header, so they pass packet[Raw] to the same function. PS4 exposed that case and PS5/6 add a regression test. The PS6 CI is still running; please let me know if you would prefer another way to express that offset.",
